|description = '''Ichinose Hidenori''' ('''一之瀬秀典''', Hidenori Ichinose), formerly known as '''Vaz''' and '''Zuh''', is an {{NNDict|Utaite}} known for his clear, powerful and emotive voice and for being a strong technical singer.

Though his voice's stringy, almost raspy lilt lends itself best to rock and soft rock, he also covers slower songs like "[http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2y2uxkBuHV8 Toys]"{{nnd|sm19702950}}.

Offline, he is one of the five core members of the live performance and collaborative group [http://hx3project.web.fc2.com/index.html Hx3 Project].
